  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1806.01 Notification for Minor Asbestos Abatement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1806.01 Notification for Minor Asbestos Abatement.\n\n(a) Except as provided in (b) and (c), below, the owner or operator of minor asbestos abatement shall not be required to notify the department regarding that project.\n\n(b) If the minor asbestos abatement is being done as part of a demolition, then the owner or operator shall submit an “Asbestos Demolition Notification” form as required by Env-A 1806.05.\n\n(c) The owner or operator of a minor asbestos abatement project shall submit an “Asbestos Transport for Disposal Notification” form as required by Env-A 1806.07.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
